==Battleground==
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Hackey]] spawns.
**3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The easiest strategy to use here is to stall the initial Shy Boy for money, preferably by stacking a large amount of [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cats]] on it. After hitting the base, spam [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] + Roe, and when your Roe stack finally reaches the first Capy, use [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] to push her behind Professor A., who cannot be knocked behind the base. With him weakened, your other attackers/rushers should be easily capable of slipping in hits until he dies. Afterwards, the remaining Capies without any real support aren't much of a threat.

